      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Pursuant to the Worker's Compensation Law, Article 1, Section 3, Subdivision 1, Group 19 - which permits any municipal corporation to bring its employees or officers, elective or appointed otherwise, within the Worker's Compensation Law by appropriate action of the legislative or governmental body of the municipal corporation - all persons employed by the City in any agency except persons employed by any public benefit corporation or the Board of Education and uniformed employees of the Police, Fire and Sanitation Departments, who are not otherwise covered under the Workers' Compensation Law and who, as of this date, have not been brought within the coverage of such law by appropriate action of the Mayor, the City Council or the Board of Estimate are hereby brought within the coverage of the Workers' Compensation Law.",
